        "created_at": "2011-08-26T20:50:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah, the old grandfather paradox.  So long as there is no one that goes back in time, kills his grandfather, then hooks up with his grandmother, effectively becoming his own grandfather.  Though that would make him immune to giant brains trying to take over the earth.</p>",
