        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-26T21:09:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What a sad day it would be if I became my own grandfather, luckily neither of my grandmothers were attractive, go me!</p>\n<p>I personally like the idea of the new universe branching off to form an alternate universe instead. Since the other one is a nonstop cycle as to what would really happen.</p>",
