        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-26T21:11:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If anyone’s interested in further reading on this, there’s the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grandfather_paradox\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Grandfather paradox</a> that TheJayMann mentioned and the answer to it in the form of the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Many-worlds_interpretation\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">many-worlds interpretation</a>. For the case of SotM, I think I’m gonna go with the latter.</p>",
